# .gitignore — Forge pen.
#
# Submoduleless by design: product checkouts live under products/ as peer
# standalone clones and are NEVER tracked by this repo. No gitlinks (mode
# 160000), no nested .git pollution in the index.
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!LICENSE
!package.json
!mise.toml
!AGENTS.md
!bin/
!bin/**
!docs/
!docs/**
